,
"use"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"en"
:
"Set the global theme feature. If the terminal environment is not specified, the value of the default terminal environment will be changed."
,
"zh"
:
"设置全局的主题 feature，如果不指定 terminal 环境，则更改的是默认 terminal 环境的值"
}
,
